### 任意角的化归（式 2.72–2.81、表 2.4）

详见 [[concepts/象限关系与简化公式]] 与 [[findings/任意角化归与象限关系公式及算例]]。

```latex
% 周期化简（n 为整数）
\sin(360°·n + α) = sin α                    (2.72)
\cos(360°·n + α) = cos α                    (2.73)
\tan(180°·n + α) = tan α                    (2.74)
\cot(180°·n + α) = cot α                    (2.75)
% 负角
\sin(-α) = -sin α                           (2.76)
\cos(-α) = cos α                            (2.77)
\tan(-α) = -tan α                           (2.78)
\cot(-α) = -cot α                           (2.79)
% 余角公式（x = 90° - α，参见原书第 168 页 3.1.1.2）
\cos α = sin x = sin(90° - α)               (2.80a)
\sin α = cos x = cos(90° - α)               (2.80b)
% 补角公式（α + x = 180°）
\sin α = sin x = sin(180° - α)              (2.81a)
-\cos α = cos x = cos(180° - α)             (2.81b)
```

表 2.4 三角函数的简化公式与象限关系（逐字保留）：

| 函数 | $x=90^\circ\pm\alpha$ | $x=180^\circ\pm\alpha$ | $x=270^\circ\pm\alpha$ | $x=360^\circ-\alpha$ |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| $\sin x$ | $+\cos\alpha$ | $\mp\sin\alpha$ | $-\cos\alpha$ | $-\sin\alpha$ |
| $\cos x$ | $\mp\sin\alpha$ | $-\cos\alpha$ | $\pm\sin\alpha$ | $+\cos\alpha$ |
| $\tan x$ | $\mp\cot\alpha$ | $\pm\tan\alpha$ | $\mp\cot\alpha$ | $-\tan\alpha$ |
| $\cot x$ | $\mp\tan\alpha$ | $\pm\cot\alpha$ | $\mp\tan\alpha$ | $-\cot\alpha$ |

算例（已独立复算）：

$$\sin(-1000^\circ) = -\sin 1000^\circ = -\sin(360^\circ\cdot 2 + 280^\circ) = -\sin 280^\circ = +\cos 10^\circ = +0.9848.$$

## 2.7.2 三角函数的重要公式（式 2.82–2.135）

详见 [[concepts/三角恒等式]] 与 [[findings/同角关系至降幂的恒等式公式族]]。各族公式逐字保留如下。

```latex
% 同角关系 (2.82–2.89)
\sin^2 α + \cos^2 α = 1                     (2.82)
\sec^2 α - \tan^2 α = 1                     (2.83)
\csc^2 α - \cot^2 α = 1                     (2.84)
\sin α · \csc α = 1                         (2.85)
\cos α · \sec α = 1                         (2.86)
\tan α · \cot α = 1                         (2.87)
\sin α / \cos α = \tan α                    (2.88)
\cos α / \sin α = \cot α                    (2.89)
```

```latex
% 加法定理 (2.90–2.95)
\sin(α ± β) = \sin α\cos β ± \cos α\sin β                     (2.90)
\cos(α ± β) = \cos α\cos β ∓ \sin α\sin β                     (2.91)
\tan(α ± β) = (\tan α ± \tan β)/(1 ∓ \tan α\tan β)           (2.92)
\cot(α ± β) = (\cot α\cot β ∓ 1)/(\cot β ± \cot α)           (2.93)
\sin(α+β+γ) = \sin α\cos β\cos γ + \cos α\sin β\cos γ
             + \cos α\cos β\sin γ - \sin α\sin β\sin γ         (2.94)
\cos(α+β+γ) = \cos α\cos β\cos γ - \sin α\sin β\cos γ
             - \sin α\cos β\sin γ - \cos α\sin β\sin γ         (2.95)
```

```latex
% 倍角 (2.96–2.107)
\sin 2α = 2\sin α\cos α                                       (2.96)
\sin 3α = 3\sin α - 4\sin^3 α                                 (2.97)
\cos 2α = \cos^2 α - \sin^2 α                                 (2.98)
\cos 3α = 4\cos^3 α - 3\cos α                                 (2.99)
\sin 4α = 8\cos^3 α\sin α - 4\cos α\sin α                     (2.100)
\cos 4α = 8\cos^4 α - 8\cos^2 α + 1                           (2.101)
\tan 2α = 2\tan α/(1 - \tan^2 α)                              (2.102)
\tan 3α = (3\tan α - \tan^3 α)/(1 - 3\tan^2 α)                (2.103)
\tan 4α = (4\tan α - 4\tan^3 α)/(1 - 6\tan^2 α + \tan^4 α)    (2.104)
\cot 2α = (\cot^2 α - 1)/(2\cot α)                            (2.105)
\cot 3α = (\cot^3 α - 3\cot α)/(3\cot^2 α - 1)                (2.106)
\cot 4α = (\cot^4 α - 6\cot^2 α + 1)/(4\cot^3 α - 4\cot α)    (2.107)
```

```latex
% 棣莫弗–二项式通式 (2.108–2.109)；编号 (2.110) 在源文中空缺
\cos nα + i\sin nα
  = \sum_{k=0}^{n} \binom{n}{k} i^k \cos^{n-k} α \sin^{k} α
  = (\cos α + i\sin α)^n
  = \cos^n α + i n\cos^{n-1} α\sin α - \binom{n}{2}\cos^{n-2} α\sin^2 α
    - i\binom{n}{3}\cos^{n-3} α\sin^3 α + \binom{n}{4}\cos^{n-4} α\sin^4 α + ⋯   (2.108)

\cos nα = \cos^n α - \binom{n}{2}\cos^{n-2} α\sin^2 α + \binom{n}{4}\cos^{n-4} α\sin^4 α - ⋯
\sin nα = n\cos^{n-1} α\sin α - \binom{n}{3}\cos^{n-3} α\sin^3 α + \binom{n}{5}\cos^{n-5} α\sin^5 α - ⋯   (2.109)
```

（通式引用原书第 48 页 1.5.3.5 棣莫弗公式与第 14 页 1.1.6.4 二项式定理，见 [[concepts/棣莫弗公式]]。）

```latex
% 半角 (2.111–2.114)，平方根符号依半角所处象限确定
\sin(α/2) = √(½(1 - \cos α))                                  (2.111)
\cos(α/2) = √(½(1 + \cos α))                                  (2.112)
\tan(α/2) = √((1-\cos α)/(1+\cos α)) = (1-\cos α)/\sin α = \sin α/(1+\cos α)   (2.113)
\cot(α/2) = √((1+\cos α)/(1-\cos α)) = (1+\cos α)/\sin α = \sin α/(1-\cos α)   (2.114)
```

```latex
% 和差化积 (2.115–2.122)
\sin α + \sin β = 2\sin((α+β)/2)\cos((α-β)/2)                 (2.115)
\sin α - \sin β = 2\cos((α+β)/2)\sin((α-β)/2)                 (2.116)
\cos α + \cos β = 2\cos((α+β)/2)\cos((α-β)/2)                 (2.117)
\cos α - \cos β = -2\sin((α+β)/2)\sin((α-β)/2)                (2.118)
\tan α ± \tan β = \sin(α ± β)/(\cos α\cos β)                  (2.119)
\cot α ± \cot β = ±\sin(α ± β)/(\sin α\sin β)                 (2.120)
\tan α + \cot β = \cos(α - β)/(\cos α\sin β)                  (2.121)
\cot α - \tan β = \cos(α + β)/(\sin α\cos β)                  (2.122)
```

```latex
% 积化和差 (2.123–2.129)
\sin α\sin β = ½[\cos(α-β) - \cos(α+β)]                       (2.123)
\cos α\cos β = ½[\cos(α-β) + \cos(α+β)]                       (2.124)
\sin α\cos β = ½[\sin(α-β) + \sin(α+β)]                       (2.125)
\sin α\sin β\sin γ = ¼[\sin(α+β-γ) + \sin(β+γ-α)
                      + \sin(γ+α-β) - \sin(α+β+γ)]            (2.126)
\sin α\cos β\cos γ = ¼[\sin(α+β-γ) - \sin(β+γ-α)
                      + \sin(γ+α-β) + \sin(α+β+γ)]            (2.127)
\sin α\sin β\cos γ = ¼[-\cos(α+β-γ) + \cos(β+γ-α)
                      + \cos(γ+α-β) - \cos(α+β+γ)]            (2.128)
\cos α\cos β\cos γ = ¼[\cos(α+β-γ) + \cos(β+γ-α)
                      + \cos(γ+α-β) + \cos(α+β+γ)]            (2.129)
```

```latex
% 降幂 (2.130–2.135)
\sin^2 α = ½(1 - \cos 2α)                                     (2.130)
\cos^2 α = ½(1 + \cos 2α)                                     (2.131)
\sin^3 α = ¼(3\sin α - \sin 3α)                               (2.132)
\cos^3 α = ¼(\cos 3α + 3\cos α)                               (2.133)
\sin^4 α = ⅛(\cos 4α - 4\cos 2α + 3)                          (2.134)
\cos^4 α = ⅛(\cos 4α + 4\cos 2α + 3)                          (2.135)
```

表 2.5 当 $0<\alpha<\frac{\pi}{2}$ 时同角三角函数间的关系（逐字保留；其他区间平方根符号依象限决定）：

| α | sin α | cos α | tan α | cot α |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| sin α | — | $\sqrt{1-\cos^2\alpha}$ | $\frac{\tan\alpha}{\sqrt{1+\tan^2\alpha}}$ | $\frac{1}{\sqrt{1+\cot^2\alpha}}$ |
| cos α | $\sqrt{1-\sin^2\alpha}$ | — | $\frac{1}{\sqrt{1+\tan^2\alpha}}$ | $\frac{\cot\alpha}{\sqrt{1+\cot^2\alpha}}$ |
| tan α | $\frac{\sin\alpha}{\sqrt{1-\sin^2\alpha}}$ | $\frac{\sqrt{1-\cos^2\alpha}}{\cos\alpha}$ | — | $\frac{1}{\cot\alpha}$ |
| cot α | $\frac{\sqrt{1-\sin^2\alpha}}{\sin\alpha}$ | $\frac{\cos\alpha}{\sqrt{1-\cos^2\alpha}}$ | $\frac{1}{\tan\alpha}$ | — |

## 2.7.3 振动的描述（式 2.136–2.139）

详见 [[concepts/正弦量与谐振荡]]、[[concepts/向量图]]、[[concepts/阻尼振荡]]。

```latex
u(t) = A\sin(\omega t + \varphi)                                                    (2.136)
u(t) = a\sin\omega t + b\cos\omega t,\quad A = √(a²+b²),\ \tan\varphi = b/a          (2.137)
A₁\sin(\omega t+\varphi₁) + A₂\sin(\omega t+\varphi₂) = A\sin(\omega t+\varphi)      (2.138a)
A = √(A₁² + A₂² + 2A₁A₂\cos(\varphi₂-\varphi₁)),
\tan\varphi = (A₁\sin\varphi₁ + A₂\sin\varphi₂)/(A₁\cos\varphi₁ + A₂\cos\varphi₂)    (2.138b)
\sum_i c_i A_i\sin(\omega t+\varphi_i) = A\sin(\omega t+\varphi)                     (2.138c)
u(t) = A e^{-at}\sin(\omega t + \varphi₀)\quad (a, t > 0)                            (2.139)
```

